					"content": "都清理完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200380303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200380303,
					"content": "真是太感謝了，願巴巴托斯保佑您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200380304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "吉麗安娜"
				},
				{
